				},
				"code" : "| view |\rview := GtPhlowColumnedListView new.\rview items: [ {\r  { 'NVD API v2'. 'Optional key'. '5 req/30s; 50 req/30s with key'. '4'. 'Authoritative CPE coverage for iOS/iPadOS, firmware, vendors (Samsung, Qualcomm, Apple). Ideal for platform/device CVEs.' }.\r  { 'OSV.dev'. 'None'. 'No documented limit'. '5'. 'Dedicated Android ecosystem ingested from Android Security Bulletins since 2020. Also Swift, Pub, Maven, npm, PyPI. Lowest-friction JSON API.' }.\r  { 'GitHub Advisory DB'. 'Token for useful quotas'. '60/hr unauth, 5000/hr authed'. '3'. 'Swift + Pub ecosystems, Maven for Android libs. No iOS/Android platform. Duplicates OSV content.' }.\r  { 'CIRCL'. 'None'. 'Fair-use'. '4'. 'Mirrors NVD + vendor feeds. Good browsing, duplicates NVD.' }.\r  { 'Vulners'. 'API key required'. 'Credit-gated free tier'. '4'. '220+ sources incl. Android. Free tier too restricted for discovery.' }.\r  { 'Android Security Bulletins'. 'None'. 'N/A'. '5 / 1'. 'Content is 5, but HTML-only — no JSON/RSS feed. Use OSV.dev as the JSON proxy.' }.\r  { 'OSSF Malicious Packages'. 'None'. 'N/A (git) or OSV'. '2'. 'Typosquat / credential-steal npm, PyPI, Maven packages. Relevant for bundled libs in RN/Flutter/Cordova apps. Mirrored into OSV.dev.' }\r} ].\rview column: 'Source' text: [ :row | row at: 1 ] weight: 1.1.\rview column: 'Auth' text: [ :row | row at: 2 ] weight: 0.6.\rview column: 'Rate limit' text: [ :row | row at: 3 ] weight: 1.1.\rview column: 'Mobile (1-5)' text: [ :row | row at: 4 ] weight: 0.7.\rview column: 'Notes' text: [ :row | row at: 5 ] weight: 2.2.\rview asElement",
